    {
      "stride": "DenialOfService",
      "title": "Automated bots drain credit budget through mass fake sign-ups",
      "scenario": "An attacker scripts account creation to generate thousands of sign-ups using different referral codes. Each sign-up creates $20 in total credits ($10 per account). With no rate limiting or CAPTCHA mentioned, the attacker exhausts the company's credit budget, preventing legitimate users from receiving their rewards and causing financial loss.",
